<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 7.98 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 7.98 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained the cut-off price at 98.05 rupees at its weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was steady at 7.98 percent.</p>
